{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello there!</strong> Sorry for the rush, but could you start tomorrow? Don\u2019t worry\u2014think of the details as \u201con-the-job training.\u201d You did study the materials I gave you in advance\u2026 right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the newest security guard at <strong>Hololive office</strong>. Your task is simple but vital: protect each talent\u2019s privacy. Counterfeit IDs, forged documents, tall tales\u2014bring nothing but your wits, your knowledge of the talents, and a whole lot of love. Minimize the damage, prove your worth, and earn that full-time contract!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691000/extras/URID_WIP20250605C.gif?t=1760928600\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pulse-pounding <strong>inspection quiz game</strong>.<br>Check each arriving talent\u2019s ID card and profile\u2014and if that\u2019s not enough, conduct a quick interview. Sniff out impostors perfectly disguised as your favorite talents. Let a fake slip through and their favorite snacks (or their darkest secrets!) might get stolen\u2026 But block the real talent by mistake and expect an angry call from upper management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a seven-day probation period as the rookie guard. You\u2019ve got a limited number of lives; lose them all and you\u2019re fired\u2014hold on to them and you\u2019re hired!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one talent and guard them forever in an endless survival challenge. One mistake means instant game over. Climb the talent-specific leaderboards with a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691000?t=1760928600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691000?t=1760928600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691000/6e5dd0185e5d914f4891053212c4bb00c3ccd225/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760928600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691000/6e5dd0185e5d914f4891053212c4bb00c3ccd225/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760928600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello there!</strong> Sorry for the rush, but could you start tomorrow? Don\u2019t worry\u2014think of the details as \u201con-the-job training.\u201d You did study the materials I gave you in advance\u2026 right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re the newest security guard at <strong>Hololive office</strong>. Your task is simple but vital: protect each talent\u2019s privacy. Counterfeit IDs, forged documents, tall tales\u2014bring nothing but your wits, your knowledge of the talents, and a whole lot of love. Minimize the damage, prove your worth, and earn that full-time contract!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691000/extras/URID_WIP20250605C.gif?t=1760928600\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pulse-pounding <strong>inspection quiz game</strong>.<br>Check each arriving talent\u2019s ID card and profile\u2014and if that\u2019s not enough, conduct a quick interview. Sniff out impostors perfectly disguised as your favorite talents. Let a fake slip through and their favorite snacks (or their darkest secrets!) might get stolen\u2026 But block the real talent by mistake and expect an angry call from upper management!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive a seven-day probation period as the rookie guard. You\u2019ve got a limited number of lives; lose them all and you\u2019re fired\u2014hold on to them and you\u2019re hired!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one talent and guard them forever in an endless survival challenge. One mistake means instant game over. Climb the talent-specific leaderboards with a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["illuCalab."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691000/8ab9fb4c91acf7226412482ed3b63deba0cc4fd2/header.jpg?t=1760928600","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3691000/920119578/d560584a101e7d2922b7a772bca9b851e56dd7f5/1750837067/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760928598","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3691000/920119578/d560584a101e7d2922b7a772bca9b851e56dd7f5/1750837067/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760928598","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3691000/920119578/d560584a101e7d2922b7a772bca9b851e56dd7f5/1750837067/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760928598","id":257155912,"name":"Debut-trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155912/813b169c97ece71b76271f6d23571503a063faf7/